[h1]Vengeful Rage[/h1]

[h2]Description[/h2]
Vengeful Rage is a RimWorld mod that enhances the game's emotional and psychological dimensions. It introduces a new mental state triggered when a pawn's spouse is killed. Affected pawns will target the individual responsible for their loss, adding depth to the social dynamics and emotional responses within your colony.
be warned.. this isn't a colony only mental state. If one of your pawns kills a raider wife in the battle field you might face an unwelcome surprise.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Focused Revenge:[/b] Targets the individual responsible for their spouse's death.
[*][b]Utilizes Available Weapons:[/b] Uses any weapon, prioritizing skill proficiency.
[*][b]Strategic Response Time:[/b] Introduces a delay before action, allowing player intervention.
[*][b]Emotional Depth:[/b] Consequences on mood and relationships post-revenge.
[/list]

[h2]Installation[/h2]
[list=1]
[*][b]Subscribe to Harmony:[/b] Essential for mod functionality. Ensure Harmony is installed first.
[*][b]Download and Install:[/b] Subscribe to "Vengeful Rage" on the Steam Workshop for automatic installation.
[*][b]Activate the Mod:[/b] In RimWorld's Mods menu, activate "Vengeful Rage," ensuring Harmony is loaded first.
[/list]

[h2]Dependencies[/h2]
- [b]Harmony:[/b] Required for the mod's functionality. Ensure it's installed and loaded before "Vengeful Rage."

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
- Broadly compatible with most mods. Conflicts may arise with mods that overhaul social or mental break systems.
- Adjust mod load order or contact for support if issues occur.

[h2]Version History[/h2]
- [b]1.0.0[/b] - Initial release:
    - New Vengeful Rage mental state.
    - Rage focus buff for mental state

Thank you for engaging with Vengeful Rage! Your feedback supports future updates and improvements.
